    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Fake index for graphs that don&apos;t have an index.</para><para>This is the index type used when a vertex or edge index is not required. It has no storage and constant lookup times. The API of the index is documented here. See <ref refid="structSawyer_1_1Container_1_1GraphIndexTraits" kindref="compound">GraphIndexTraits</ref> for information about how to override the index type for a graph. </para>    </detaileddescription>
